Project: dav1d (AV1 decoder; C only)
URL: https://code.videolan.org/videolan/dav1d (https://downloads.videolan.org/pub/videolan/dav1d/1.5.5/)
Version: 1.5.5
License: BSD-2-Clause (see COPYING)
Used for: the AV1 pictures of AVIF images (kit/extern/libavif, codec_dav1d.c).

Copied unmodified: src/*.c and src/*.h, src/win32/thread.c (pthreads on Windows), include/
(common, compat, dav1d). The *_tmpl.c files are compiled twice, with BITDEPTH=8 and
BITDEPTH=16 (meson.build: libdav1d_bitdepth_objs), for 8- and 10/12-bit images. Not copied:
the assembly (x86, arm, ppc, riscv, loongarch: x86's needs NASM), tools, tests, examples.

BUI files (bui/):
  config.h        what meson.build writes to config.h: no assembly (HAVE_ASM 0, every ARCH_*
                  0: the C DSP functions everywhere), 8 and 16 bpc, no logging, no dlsym
  vcs_version.h   what meson writes from include/vcs_version.h.in ("1.5.5")
